  "description": "\"Survive? I'm just a little Maltese!\"\n\nPpiyong was living a cozy, carefree life in a warm home with her loving sister—until one day, her family and all the humans suddenly disappeared. She's never done anything on her own before—will she find a way to survive in a city overrun by zombie dogs and reunite with her sister?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=814594), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10111737)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/HEALING/gougoutaowangji/list?title_no=2870), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/slice-of-life/run-like-a-dog/list?title_no=5922), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0004318)",
